    "title": "THE FORMER BOYFRIEND, LATER RECLASSIFIED",
    "year": "Early Romantic Period",
    "labelLines": [
      {
        "text": "Originally catalogued as a boyfriend, the sitter was later successfully reclassified as a friend — an unusually stable transition by historical standards."
      },
      {
        "text": "The arrangement remained operational until the arrival of a new romantic administration, after which contact ceased abruptly."
      },
      {
        "text": "He has since entered a new phase of life and recently became a father."
      },
      {
        "text": "Archival records also confirm the temporary transfer of an elderly green vehicle for an expedition to the dacha."
      },
      {
        "text": "STATUS: ACCESS REVOKED BY THIRD-PARTY ADMINISTRATION",
        "bold": true
      }
